Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:40.71,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}色付く気持ちは誰のせい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:52.55,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}何度向かい合っても慣れない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:59.60,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}見つめないで そんな澄んだ瞳(め)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:04.56,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}カップの中 映る私 いま
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.82,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どんな顔してるかで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:13.24,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}答えはきっと隠せない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:17.53,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}苦いはずの日々もあなたとなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:19.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}〈When I'm with you〉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:22.03,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ケーキより甘すぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:25.67,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}少し控えめにして
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:32.72,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ここから始まる奇跡 喜びの歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.72,0:01:40.02,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}祈りは無数の光もたらすでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:43.14,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}膨らむ幸せが
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.52,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}零れてしまわぬように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:49.02,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}飲み干しましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:52.95,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}色付く気持ちを味わって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:58.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}〈It's Okey if it's too sweet〉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:40.71,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}心緒多采多姿是因為誰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:52.55,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}即使已經面對無數次 依舊不習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:59.60,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}不要用那麼透澈的眼眸盯著我看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:04.56,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}倒映在杯中的我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.82,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}現在是什麼表情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:13.24,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一切想必無所遁形
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:17.53,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只要和你一起 無論日子多苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:19.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}〈When I'm with you〉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:22.03,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}也比糕點更甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:25.67,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}記得要克制一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:32.72,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}從現在開始的奇蹟 歡喜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.72,0:01:40.02,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}祈禱必定會帶來無數光明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:43.14,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}為了不讓漲大的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.52,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}再從手心溜走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:49.02,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一飲而盡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:52.95,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}嚐嚐多采多姿的心緒是什麼滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:58.91,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}〈It's Okey if it's too sweet〉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,900)}「終幕」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才那隻像山豬的魔物…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也是從礦山的沼澤中出現的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,還不曉得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只不過
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,這個地方在瘴氣變濃之前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就不是有這麼多魔物的地區
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可是那頭山豬看起來很大隻耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然沒有看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但既然那種尺寸的魔物出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就代表可能發生了什麼非同以往的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,團長 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我們這邊有無敵的聖女大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要是情況緊急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我們會充當盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,保護好聖女大人的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只要聖平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,總會有辦法解決啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一定會捨身保護妳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,其實…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有想嘗試的新魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,目標那麼大 是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好 趕路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再來順著路走 就會到礦坑入口了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,請各位萬事小心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不過這裡面還真是荒涼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,請小心周圍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼氣味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我聞到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,終於出現了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,覺得難受的話 就先後退
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,聖 妳待在後面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不死族是已經失去生命的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,即使以為打倒了 也不能鬆懈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,比聽說的還要輕鬆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,因為都腐爛了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,味道好重…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我說也沒用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.47,0:05:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,前面都會是這個樣子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如妳所見 這裡空氣不流通
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果繼續靠近沼澤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只會更嚴重 不會改善吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不嫌棄的話 用這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,遮住口鼻會稍微好一點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可…可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那當然
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我們快往前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不死族的數量開始增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看來距離黑色沼澤不遠了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但不曉得大家的體力能不能撐到沼澤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已經來到礦坑的深處了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就算暫時撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要再回到這裡也不是一件易事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都受了不少傷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我能使用區域治癒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,聖小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,直到淨化沼澤前 都要保存魔力對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是每天都在成長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,魔力已經增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,聖女之術也勉強能用個兩次啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然沒有一天成功使出兩次啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,光我一個人受你們保護 我很過意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也請讓我做些我能做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 聖小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那就麻煩妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,區域治癒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好驚人的數量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然想盡可能靠近沼澤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但要在這種數量下保護聖小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,實在難如登天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以讓我做個實驗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,實驗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想試試看我能不能淨化黑色沼澤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就算沒辦法淨化
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:09:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也想看看能產生什麼影響
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可是魔物的數量這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,讓你以外的人去應付
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,會伴隨相當高的風險
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可是有嘗試的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果聖小姐以外的人也能淨化
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她就不必冒著危險靠近沼澤了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣聖小姐也比較安全吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我嘗試第一道攻擊就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真的只能試第一道攻擊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要動手了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,聖光箭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好像行不通耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,聖小姐 請準備好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真有妳的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是聖女大人的力量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,威力超強的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她明明才剛使用範圍魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是令人不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我還以為終於開發出\N能干涉黑色沼澤的魔法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,結果三兩下就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,師團長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,說得好像不希望討伐結束一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對不是希望黑色沼澤再出現喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.55,0:11:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,小心腳邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,團長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,光明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,總之
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只能先順著路走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不過在走之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我真厲害 藥水效果超群
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,活力百倍了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你幫了大忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是我自作主張才該道歉…對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你的判斷很明智
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那隻魔物是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,按照過去的狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,淨化黑色沼澤後
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,周邊一帶的魔物應該都會暫時消失
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但剛才襲擊我們的不死族…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克團長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這塊土地以前沒有不死族對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,理應被淨化的沼澤範圍內
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,出現了不該有的魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,現在都只是推測
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,無論如何 必須先和聖小姐會合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就算聖女之術再強
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她本身也無法直接和魔物戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,趕快找到一條可以安全往下的路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 去找聖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺沒有能往上的路
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,又覺得不能隨便亂走\N完全遠離掉下來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他們應該也都在找我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家找得到我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我們…還能再見面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就算被人吹捧說是聖女
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,卻只能被人保護
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一個人根本無能為力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子餓了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.99,0:15:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已經走到很下面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可是沒有能當線索的東西耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,聖小姐 您在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,聖小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有風…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,風?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,從前面吹過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.07,0:15:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定…有通往外面的路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,妳在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:15:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克大人?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.68,0:16:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克大人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,聖…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好妳平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,團長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 看來妳平安無事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,讓…讓各位擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是什麼地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,屍龍…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,淨化剛才的沼澤後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,之所以還有殘存的魔物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為這裡才是本體啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,德勒韋斯大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果規模這麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,盡量靠近一點比較好 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這…這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,冰之障壁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,烈焰之槍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,聖光箭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有效
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,聖小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,請準備使用法術
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:18:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,德勒韋斯大人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.02,0:19:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,反射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,聖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,聖 快點淨化
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,烈焰風暴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,聖小姐 沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一定會保護妳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:40.88,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}昨日は少し 震えていた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:46.89,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}今も少し戸惑ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:53.60,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}時計のように刻む想い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:58.98,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}羞恥心が言葉を遮って
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:04.57,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}顔赤らめ逸らしてしまう目線
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:11.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}だけど言わなくちゃ伝わらないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:17.84,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}風よ運んで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:22.05,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Lilac melody
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:24.84,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}小さい花の
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:31.98,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ひとつひとつが 私の気持ちです
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.98,0:22:35.65,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}愛しさも切なさも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:38.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}束ねたらほら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:48.36,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}世界であなただけへ 送るブーケ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:40.88,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}昨天我微微顫抖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:46.89,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}現在也有些困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:53.60,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}這份宛如鐘錶 不斷刻劃出的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:58.98,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}言語被羞恥心掩蓋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:04.57,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}視線因臉紅而錯開
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:11.54,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}但如果不說出口 你就不會懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:17.84,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}風兒 替我傳遞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:22.05,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Lilac melody
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:24.84,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}每一朵嬌小的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:31.98,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}都是我的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.98,0:22:35.65,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}無論心動還是心痛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:38.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只要全繫在一起 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:48.36,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就成了全世界專屬於你的花束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.04,0:23:41.04,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,900)}「思慕」
